# Anthiel copy management

No i18n library required yet — keep a `t()` shim for `{name}` interpolation.

## Layout

```
apps/<app>/src/lib/copy/
  t.ts
  common.ts
  api-errors.ts          # code → copy + messageForApiError()

apps/<app>/src/features/<feature>/copy.ts
```

Cross-app labels → `packages/constants` when shared.

## Dict shape

```ts
const cartCopy = {
  title: "…",
  itemCount: "{count} item",
  empty: { title: "…", description: "…" },
} as const;
```

Usage: `cartCopy.title`, `t(cartCopy.itemCount, { count: 3 })`, `commonCopy.cancel`.

## Rules

- New features **must** use dicts; migrate old strings opportunistically
- API toasts: `toast.error(messageForApiError(error.code, error.message))`
- Zod API messages stay English; UI form validation → frontend copy
- Prefer finishing partial migrations before new copy work (`migration.yml` / `MIGRATION.md` when present)

## Enforcement

When the repo has ast-grep rules for JSX text literals: `bun run sg:scan`.
